.</p>"}, "options": [{"id": "933355", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are true.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8a2ee0e063d92990d6"}, {"id": "4fa64a", "text": "Both Statement I and Statement II are false.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8a2ee0e063d92990d7"}, {"id": "6ad8c0", "text": "Statement I is true but Statement II is false.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8a2ee0e063d92990d8"}, {"id": "643857", "text": "Statement I is false but Statement II is true.", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8a2ee0e063d92990d9"}], "questionLabels": []}, {"_id": "69de4f8a2ee0e063d92990da", "type": "singleCorrect", "chapters": ["60ced5dd19d2aa2b78a3a78c"], "topics": ["60e2fb5766f9ce3f243b4f43"], "concepts": ["61adb6fadec0c790740adaef"], "question": {"text": "The correct structure of the product <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8216;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8217;</mi></math> in the following reaction is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Asn</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>Ser</mi><mo>+</mo><munder><mrow><msub><mrow><mo>(</mo><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi>CO</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>excess</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></munder><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><msub><mi>NEt</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math>"}, "options": [{"id": "8aeae5", "text": "<p><img height=\"133\" src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F4deac244-83db-49ff-ada3-5a0e4e801ff7-image.png?alt=media\" width=\"277\" /></p>", "isCorrect": null, "_id": "69de4f8a2ee0e063d92990db"}, {"id": "abd0fb", "text": "<p><img height=\"136\" src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/quantrexacademy-app.firebasestorage.app/o/questions%2Ffigs%2Fpyq%2Fjee_main%2F50323d75-d266-4a59-af9a-fadb6f5fc75d-image.png?alt=media\" width=\